      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T15:17:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is needed. This overrides the default:\n- Disabled by default for embedders (e.g. gn/skia.gni)\n- Enabled in Skia standalone (e.g. \u003cskia\u003e/.gn) to get a sufficient coverage on Skia CQ: dangling pointers + other memory safety checks, before rolling Skia into Chrome.\n- (Soon) Enabled in Chrome (e.g. \u003cchrome\u003e/.gn) who will set:\n```\n  skia_use_partition_alloc \u003d true\n  skia_partition_alloc_dir \u003d \"base/allocator/partition_allocator/\"\n```\n\nWDYT?\nThis is important not to affect any embedders of Skia.",
      "parentUuid": "a39a88f2_dfc285b6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "5f98f29e369956db62f919b74afef706b229e720",
