      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T15:17:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would like to keep the TestSupport.h includable from everyone. This is similar to what happens in [dawn](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/tests/DawnTest.cpp;l\u003d297-298;drc\u003db3eab4fd06ddbeee84b37224f4cc9d78094fc2f7;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1).\n\nIf I follow this suggestion the drawbacks are:\n- I need to move the `#if defined(...)` from TestSupport to DM. (+ nanobench).\n- I need to import \"partition_alloc.gni\" to know if BackupRefPtr is possible on the CPU/Platform. I prefer to import it from \"test_support\" only to reduce the scope. I would like to avoid leaking its content into your main BUILD.gn file.\n\nWDYT? I will let you decide.",
